insert_after('references/task-observer.md','## Resolve and initialize\n','\nA detected global Task-Observer is the sole capture owner for that host. Status reports `provider: global`, `runNow: false`, and bundled capture disabled. Do not initialize GDS checkpoint capture, call its bundled observer helper, or open a second log. For an explicit `/gds-superpowers observe`, use only `delegateGlobal: true` and inspect the returned absolute global entry before handing off once. An unavailable, changed or incompatible entry blocks handoff; never silently enable the fallback. Installed global files and independent hooks remain unchanged.\n')
replace('references/task-observer.md','Load the configured companion only when effective auto or an explicit request permits.','When no global owner is detected, load the configured companion only when effective auto or an explicit request permits.')
replace('references/task-observer.md','In auto mode initialize in the active session,','For bundled-provider auto mode initialize in the active session,')
insert_after('INSTALL.md','## Ask the activation question\n','\nFirst inspect the selected host for an existing global Task-Observer. For Claude this normally means `~/.claude/skills/task-observer/SKILL.md`; Codex uses `~/.agents/skills/task-observer/SKILL.md`. Linked entries are read-only, and a custom bundled name does not bypass detection of the standard global skill. Detection is host-specific.\n\nWhen found, show one status: **Existing global Task-Observer detected. Bundled GDS capture disabled.** The installer saves the global provider, skips its bundled companion, and removes only intact GDS-owned startup blocks with backups. Global files, history, hooks and activation settings are never changed. A prior local copy is preserved but is not used by GDS. Do not claim global initialization merely from its presence.\n\nIf every selected host has a global observer, skip the bundled automatic/manual question. Otherwise ask once for the remaining hosts. An auto flag does not override global ownership; immediate GDS activation for that host is refused. Missing or invalid global entries prevent fallback capture and require inspection. `/gds-superpowers observe` hands off to the inspected global owner once; it does not create another GDS log.\n')
replace('INSTALL.md','Before installing to a repository OR globally, ask:','For selected hosts without a global observer, before installing to a repository OR globally, ask:')
insert_after('INSTALL.md','## After Yes: initialize in the repository session\n','\nThis section applies only to a bundled provider. Never execute a GDS initialization prompt for a host whose global observer was detected.\n')
insert_after('README.md','## Entry points\n','\nGuided brainstorming offers dynamic suggestions based on the current conversation, plus a custom answer. Native Claude choices are preferred when usable; numbered Markdown with **Write my own answer** is the fallback. Known answers are reused. See [interaction examples](examples/guided-session.md).\n')
insert_after('README.md','## Installation and migration\n','\nAn existing global Task-Observer disables the GDS-bundled capture path for that host. Installation preserves its files and settings, adds no duplicate companion/startup loop, and routes explicit observation requests to the same global owner.\n')
insert_heading('TASK-OBSERVER.md','\n**Global-owner policy:** A detected global Task-Observer disables the GDS-bundled capture path. Existing global configuration and logs remain authoritative. The installer does not add a companion or GDS startup loop for that host; explicit observation hands off once, never to a second ledger. See [installation](INSTALL.md).\n')
file=ROOT/'companions/task-observer/SKILL.template.md';text=file.read_text();marker=text.find('\n---',4)
if not text.startswith('---\n') or marker<0: raise SystemExit('Unexpected companion frontmatter')
end=marker+len('\n---')
file.write_text(text[:end]+'\n\nFor GDS-owned requests, inspect the effective observer provider first. If a global observer owns capture, do not record through this companion or its helper; return to the coordinator for a single global handoff. Do not change the external observer or start a second log.'+text[end:])
insert_heading('QUICKSTART.md','\nBrainstorming now provides session-specific suggested answers and a custom-answer option. A detected global Task-Observer takes precedence; GDS bundled capture and duplicate startup are disabled for that host.\n')
